OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly mist and fog patches
OL,6,Fclearing then a wet and cloudy day
OL,7,Facross the region, with some heavy
OL,8,Fdownpours later in parts of Cornwall.
OL,9,FBreezy especially along coasts and
OL,10,Fover hills. Feeling chilly for the
OL,11,Ftime of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining damp and cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight, with rain steadily easing
OL,15,Fby morning and breezy with strongest
OL,16,Fwinds becoming confined to the Bristol
OL,17,FChannel. A milder night than Monday
OL,18,Fnight for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
