OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAfter a wet and cloudy
OL,6,Fstart on Wednesday, turning drier and
OL,7,Fbrighter by the evening for many.
OL,8,FFeeling chilly with winds picking up
OL,9,Falong coasts later.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FIsolated mist and fog patches to start
OL,13,FThursday, but dry and bright for most
OL,14,Fafter this and into the weekend.
OL,15,FFeeling colder with overnight frosts
OL,16,Fand brisk winds initially.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
